{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳與一名被美國情報部門懷疑與中國情報機構有關聯的華裔商界人士之間的關係，正在從企業高管個人爭議演變為美國國會圍繞先進晶片出口政策展開的新一輪政治博弈。原本一直受到英偉達遊說阻力的多項對華晶片出口管制法案，如今獲得了新的推動力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585892.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:09.541365+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:38:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.460180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.460180+00:00","content_hash":"c448d0a684aa262db70c38481fdb996ce23628c28b93ad0dfd8c147530f075dd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}